Please refine the existing POM Analyzer UI only, addressing the following layout and result-classification issues. Reuse the current implementation and avoid unnecessary changes to other Release Readiness features.

1. Reorganize the Layout

* Move the search bar and component-analysis metadata section (component count, dependency checks, etc.) toward the top.
* Display Library Baseline immediately below this section.
* Show Library Baseline by default, regardless of whether a component is selected in the search/filter control.
